# {{appName}}

STOMP streaming app — HostedMarketsGrid + SharedWorker + bundled `stomp-view-server`.

## Run

```bash
npm ci
npm run dev          # Vite app on :{{port}}
npm run dev:stomp    # WebSocket server on :8081
```

In the grid, press **Alt+Shift+P** (Win/Linux) or **Cmd+Shift+P** (Mac) and select **STOMP Positions (local)**.

## Theme architecture

`applyTheme()` → `[data-theme]` → MarketsGrid `useGridTheme()` → `agGridDarkTheme` / `agGridLightTheme` from `@wellsfargo-starui/design-system/adapters/ag-grid`.
